---
import { ASSESSMENT_HREF, SERVICES_HREF } from '../../lib/home';
---

<section class="not-prose relative md:-mt-[76px] md:pt-[76px]">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-primary/10 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <p class="text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-primary dark:text-blue-200">
        DIGITAL IMMIGRATION &amp; BUSINESS SERVICES
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-heading mb-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl dark:text-white">
        Your international plans deserve{' '}
        <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-primary to-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent">honest guidance.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-4 max-w-3xl text-xl text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        Visa preparation, education pathways and company registration — handled digitally, clearly and carefully.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl text-base text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        We help individuals and businesses understand requirements, prepare documentation and navigate complex
        international processes without confusion or false promises.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        100% online • Clear scope • Written fees • No false guarantees
      </p>
      <div class="flex max-w-xs sm:max-w-md mx-auto flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
        <a class="btn-primary w-full sm:mb-0 sm:w-auto" href={ASSESSMENT_HREF}>Start My Assessment</a>
        <a class="btn w-full sm:w-auto" href={SERVICES_HREF}>Explore Our Services</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        You stay informed at every step. We handle the preparation and guidance. Authorities make the final decisions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
